<p>Thank you for your recent order!&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>We are currently reviewing your order and require more information on your shaft.&nbsp;&nbsp;Before we can finalize our production prints, we need to verify one important detail: the&nbsp;<b>Drill and Tap Size.&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>The drill and tap is specified by the diameter and number of threads per inch (example: 1/2-13 UNC is 1/2" diameter with 13 threads per inch).&nbsp;<br />
